<title>PAKISTAN: SQUASH-WORLD OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-WORLD OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the men's</p>
<p>World Open squash championship on Sunday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat Craig Wapnick (South Africa)</p>
<p>15-8 15-10 15-6</p>
<p>Jonathon Power (Canada) beat Danny Meddings (England) 15-8 15-5</p>
<p>17-16</p>
<p>7-Simon Parke (England) beat David Evans (Wales) 15-11 15-7</p>
<p>15-13</p>
<p>Julien Bonetat (France) beat Paul Gregory (Greece) 15-9 13-15</p>
<p>13-15 15-11 15-13</p>
<p>4-Peter Nicol (Scoland) beat Juha Raumolin (Finland) 15-8 15-14</p>
<p>13-15 15-12</p>
<p>Ahmed Barada (Egypt) beat Martin Heath (Scotland) 15-11 16-17</p>
<p>15-12 15-12</p>
<p>Craig Rowland (Australia) beat Alex Gough (Wales) 15-5 15-5</p>
<p>15-11</p>
<p>Add first round: 6-Del Harris (England) beat Dan Jenson</p>
<p>(Australia) 15-14 15-13 14-15 12-15 15-14</p>
</text>
